[00:12.63]Treading wept of yesterday, for what we sing today
[00:20.30]Silent martyrs' flames, burning for phonies' grin
[00:26.56]Sacred breezes, let the bygone return
[00:33.37]All defiers, slashing disbelief
[00:40.24]Cleave the dark apart
[00:46.40]Through the blood, through the sinners' cries
[00:52.41]Cleave unto the hope, to the fate, to the heart, to the glory of all
[01:02.50]Dawn is breaking in now
[01:22.42]Flame of sun, songs of moon keep on playing with roaring tides
[01:32.19]Rising from our despair
[01:35.04]Take the veils off, show the truth underneath
[01:41.33]Succumb to none, shatter the shackles, break them free
[01:48.06]Set them free
[02:01.27]Swallow pieces of sorrow
[02:07.72]Absorb all the pain
[02:14.07]Breathing in, breathing out, hold on tight
[02:18.52]Sliver lining of all, our last chance
[02:25.68]Despite blurry clouds blind my eyes
[02:29.62]Can't rewrite our triumphs on my mind
[02:36.45]Victory is shining bright
[02:40.40]Cleave the dark apart
[02:46.60]Through the blood hears the sinners' cries
[02:52.60]Cleave to 'all will survive' to leap of faith
[02:56.88]Cleave to 'don't look behind', to dawn's here to stay
[03:02.16]Forever